  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "id": "msg_t003gym01_gym_01",
      "hash": "cfeec5c10668e430",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "需要我給[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳一些\\n挑戰道館館主時的建議嗎？"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "id": "msg_t003gym01_gym_02",
      "hash": "cfeec8c10668e949",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "好！\\n那麼……！"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "id": "msg_t003gym01_gym_03",
      "hash": "cfeec7c10668e796",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "在對戰中\\n最先上場的寶可夢……\\r\\n是位於同行寶可夢列表中\\r\\n左上角的那隻！\\c\\n適時改變寶可夢的順序，\\n就能使戰鬥更有利於我方！\\r\\n試試看吧！"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "id": "msg_t003gym01_gym_04",
      "hash": "cfeecac10668ecaf",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳不用跟我客氣啦！\\n那麼……！"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "id": "msg_t003gym01_gym_05",
      "hash": "cfeec9c10668eafc",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "果然厲害！\\n就照這個勢頭\\r\\n朝寶可夢冠軍的目標邁進吧！"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "id": "msg_t003gym01_statue_01",
      "hash": "0af8263e63820107",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "深灰市寶可夢道館\\n小剛認證訓練家！\\r\\n[VAR TRNAME(0001)]"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "id": "msg_t003gym01_statue_02",
      "hash": "0af8273e638202ba",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "深灰市寶可夢道館\\n小剛認證訓練家！\\r\\n[VAR TRNAME(0001)]、[VAR TRNAME(0000)]"
    }
  ],
